<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan plans T$15 bln T-bill auction on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan plans T$15 bln T-bill auction on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan will auction T$15 billion in 91-day treasury bills on Tuesday, the finance ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>The actual issue date is Wednesday, the ministry said. Maturation is October 15.</p>
<p>The ministry on July 9 passed on an auction of T$10 billion treasury bills because the bids failed to reach the base price.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (886-2-5080815)</p>
